# With completed hidden, the project picker leaves done projects out; shown again, they can be picked.
file <<END
Archive: @done(2026-09-01)
	- Old
Active:
	- a
END
keys gc qq
type Note this
keys <Space> /
see Active
hide Archive
keys <Esc> <BS> <BS> <Esc> gc qq
type Note this
keys <Space> /
type arch
keys <Enter> <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
Archive: @done(2026-09-01)
	- Old
	- Note this
Active:
	- a
END
